{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 1416,
  "hub_id": 1962,
  "guid": "com.acidphantasm.defaultfiremode",
  "name": "Default Fire Mode Fixer",
  "slug": "default-fire-mode-fixer",
  "teaser": "Fixes weapons to default to full auto instead of single fire.\r\nShotguns default to double instead of single if available.\r\nSMGs default to Full Auto over Single / Burst",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1962.png",
  "downloads": 13216,
  "favourites_count": 15,
  "description": "<p>This mod was built to be extremely simple with as little impact as possible. It just sorts the weapFireType by key length, which makes for a much better sorting system for the fire types than default.</p>\n<p>If you want this to impact non-vanilla weapons, you will need to adjust your load order to put this mod below the custom weapon mods.</p>\n<p><strong>This only impacts weapons that you buy from traders and find in raid.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>SPT will still remember your previous FireMode selection on raid exit and set it accordingly on the weapon.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Same with AI in raid, if they switch to Single Fire, it will be Single Fire until it’s changed in raid.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"wMIskD3.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-defaultfiremode</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1416/default-fire-mode-fixer",
